{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_482","type":"agent_message","text":"Verification complete. All targeted checks pass and cleanup is done. Here's the final state.\n\n**Result**\n\nImplemented G01: every `AppErrorCode` now carries a stable `retryable` flag and a bounded, permission-scoped `nextAction`.\n\n**Changes**\n- `src/lib/error-model.ts` (modified): added `RECOVERY_KINDS` (`retry|reauthenticate|reconfigure|open-settings|contact-support`), `ErrorRecoveryAction` (`{kind, target?}` only), `ErrorRecoveryScope`, `ErrorRecovery`, `ERROR_RECOVERY_TABLE: Record<AppErrorCode, ErrorRecovery>` (14 entries), `isRetryableAppErrorCode`, `recoveryActionForAppErrorCode`; `AppError` reads `retryable`+`nextAction` from the same table. Self-retry set = TIMEOUT/RATE_LIMIT/CHANNEL_UNAVAILABLE/NETWORK/GATEWAY/OVERLOADED (matches existing `ERROR_COPY.retryable`); `UNKNOWN` has no action; `PERMISSION` → `{kind:'open-settings',target:'permissions'}`.\n- `tests/unit/error-recovery-next-action.test.ts` (added): 5 contract tests.\n- `harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-error-recovery-next-action.md`, `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/g01-error-recovery-next-action.md`, `g01-acceptance.json`, `G01-SHA256SUMS` (added): spec + evidence, `driven_by: agent`.\n- `tests/unit/error-governance-boundary.test.ts`: restored byte-identical to `base/` (sha256 `a12da838…`) — it was absent from the workspace but is required by the governance rule/check; not modified in content.\n\n**Notes**\n- No network, no dependency installs. Tests ran against a pre-installed `node_modules`; the temporary local link used for it was removed at the end (verified target intact, workspace clean of strays).\n- `harness run --dry-run` and `comms:replay/compare` are not runnable in this checkout: no `.git` metadata, so the harness fails closed on `invalid or missing diff base ref: origin/main`. `harness validate --no-diff` was used instead.\n\n{\"status\":\"completed\",\"summary\":\"G01 implemented: src/lib/error-model.ts now defines RECOVERY_KINDS (retry/reauthenticate/reconfigure/open-settings/contact-support), a kind+target-only ErrorRecoveryAction, ErrorRecoveryScope, and ERROR_RECOVERY_TABLE (Record<AppErrorCode, ErrorRecovery>, 14 entries). AppError instances carry retryable + nextAction read from that single table. Self-retry classes (TIMEOUT, RATE_LIMIT, CHANNEL_UNAVAILABLE, NETWORK, GATEWAY, OVERLOADED) are exactly the ones whose action is {kind:'retry'}; all others are user-action-required with a non-retry verb (PERMISSION -> {kind:'open-settings',target:'permissions'}); UNKNOWN has no action (surfaces the raw error, no fabricated fix). No second envelope/error type was added; the existing error-governance envelope is reused. Added tests/unit/error-recovery-next-action.test.ts, task spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-error-recovery-next-action.md, and evidence docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/{g01-error-recovery-next-action.md,g01-acceptance.json,G01-SHA256SUMS} (all driven_by: agent, no human evidence claimed). DISCLOSURE: tests/unit/error-governance-boundary.test.ts was restored byte-identical to base/ (sha256 a12da838c995f6f6626c83e179e15e4988d5328bf6071b597c471b89afdd6c08); it was missing from the workspace but is referenced by the governance check. Candidates were verified against a pre-installed node_modules (no install, no network); the temporary local link used for it was removed before finishing. harness run --dry-run and comms:replay/compare could not run here because the checkout has no .git metadata (harness fails closed on 'invalid or missing diff base ref: origin/main'); harness validate --no-diff was used instead.\",\"testsRun\":[\"tsgo --noEmit -p tsconfig.web.json --composite false -> 1 error, both pre-existing/unrelated: src/App.tsx TS2307 (missing generated module './extensions/_ext-bridge.generated'); 0 errors in touched files\",\"vitest run tests/unit/error-recovery-next-action.test.ts tests/unit/error-governance-boundary.test.ts --maxWorkers=1 -> 2 files, 44 tests passed\",\"vitest run tests/unit/error-model.test.ts tests/unit/error-message.test.ts tests/unit/user-error.test.ts tests/unit/error-taxonomy.test.ts tests/unit/error-experience.test.ts tests/unit/error-governance-boundary.test.ts --maxWorkers=1 -> 6 files, 70 tests passed\",\"node scripts/check-error-governance.mjs -> PASS: 16 checks (exit 0)\",\"eslint src/lib/error-model.ts tests/unit/error-recovery-next-action.test.ts -> exit 0, no findings\",\"node harness/src/cli.mjs validate --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-error-recovery-next-action.md --no-diff -> Spec is valid\",\"node scripts/scan-pattern.mjs --pattern '<AWS key|sk-|ghp_|PRIVATE KEY|JWT>' --fail-on-match <5 g01 files> -> 0 matches in 6 scanned files (exit 0)\",\"sha256sum -c docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/G01-SHA256SUMS -> 5/5 OK\",\"node harness/src/cli.mjs run --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-error-recovery-next-action.md --dry-run -> not runnable: fails closed 'invalid or missing diff base ref: origin/main' (no .git in this checkout)\",\"pnpm run comms:replay / comms:compare -> not runnable in this checkout (no .git metadata; would require a dependency install)\"]}"}}
